          <change when="2024-01-12T13:40:35-05:00" who="http://papyri.info/editor/users/costasbala">General - I understand ἀποταγῇ μέρος as "to cite a passage", lit. "let a section/excerpt be designated". Then, he cites(?) "σιγὴ γὰρ παρὰ φιλοσόφοις ἀπόκρισις," which sounds like something taken from a literary work.</change>
